      "side": 1,
      "message": "Few update:\nI found the root cause was from the lack of libbpf or libgoogle-glog for aarch64 cross compilation. Unlike libstdc++, I haven\u0027t found any installable packages for performing cross compilation.\n\n```\nReading package lists...\nBuilding dependency tree...\nReading state information...\nbpftool is already the newest version (7.4.0+6.9.10-1rodete5).\nclang is already the newest version (1:16.0-58.1).\ng++-aarch64-linux-gnu is already the newest version (4:13.2.0-7).\nlibbpf-dev is already the newest version (1:1.3.0-2).\nlibgoogle-glog-dev is already the newest version (0.6.0-2.1).\nSummary:\n  Upgrading: 0, Installing: 0, Removing: 0, Not Upgrading: 0\n/usr/bin/aarch64-linux-gnu-ld: cannot find -lbpf: No such file or directory\n/usr/bin/aarch64-linux-gnu-ld: cannot find -lglog: No such file or directory\nclang: error: linker command failed with exit code 1 (use -v to see invocation)\nAVF/20-port_listener FAILED with exit code 1.\n```",
